OL,3,AA united Ireland would be 'fantastic'
OL,4,Asays Trump during Irish visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump said a united Ireland would
OL,7,Fhappen eventually and that the
OL,8,FTaoiseach was "the right man over here
OL,9,Fto get it moving".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
