OL,3,AUkraine faces 'toughest winter' since
OL,4,ARussia's full-scale invasion, UN
OL,5,Aofficial tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkraine is facing its "toughest winter"
OL,8,Fsince Russia's full-scale invasion in
OL,9,F2022, a top United Nations official
OL,10,Ftold the BBC.
OL,12,FAlexander De Croo, head of the UN
OL,13,Fdevelopment agency, said there was a
OL,14,Frisk of "humanitarian catastrophe" if
OL,15,FRussian attacks cut off access to power
OL,16,Fand water.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
